@startuml
left to right direction

title Use Case Diagram for AI-Powered Analysis & Insights System

rectangle "System" {
  usecase "CFR001: View Financial Insights Dashboard" as CFR001
  usecase "SAFR002: Manage Anomaly Detection Parameters" as SAFR002
  usecase "CFR003: View Financial Predictions" as CFR003
  usecase "CFR004: Receive Personalized Recommendations" as CFR004
  usecase "CFR005: Manage Recommendation Preferences" as CFR005
  usecase "CFR006: View Spending Limit Alerts" as CFR006
  usecase "CFR007: Access Investment Opportunities" as CFR007
  usecase "CFR008: Receive Financial News" as CFR008
  usecase "CFR009: Manage Relationship with Advisors" as CFR009
  usecase "SAFR001: Manage Analysis Parameters for AI System" as SAFR001
  usecase "FAFR002: View Client Intervention Alerts" as FAFR002
  usecase "SFR003: Request Financial Predictions from AI" as SFR003
  usecase "SFR004: Request Personalized Recommendations from AI" as SFR004
  usecase "SFR005: Request Spending Limit Alerts from AI" as SFR005
  usecase "SFR006: Request Investment Opportunity Analysis from AI" as SFR006
  usecase "SFR012: Generate Client Dashboards" as SFR012
  usecase "AIFR003: Detect Unusual Spending Patterns for Alerts" as AIFR003

  actor "Client" as Client
  actor "System Administrator" as SysAdmin
  actor "Financial Advisor" as FAFRA
}

SysAdmin --> SAFR001 : Configure system parameters  
Client --> CFR001, CFR002, CFR003, CFR004, CFR005, CFR006, CFR007, CFR008, CFR009: "View/Interact with Financial Insights"  

SysAdmin --> SAFR002 : Manage anomaly detection parameters  
Client --> SFR005 : View spending limit alerts when exceeding thresholds  

Client --> FAFRA : Schedule mentoring sessions (FAFR001)  
Client --> FAFRA, SysAdmin: Receive client intervention alerts (FAFR002), manage analysis parameters for AI system (SAFR001)  

Financial Advisor --> SAFR003, SFR006, AIFR004 : Request financial predictions and investment opportunities from the system  
Client --> FAFRA, SysAdmin: Manage relationship with advisors (CFR009), view client dashboards (SFR012)

SysAdmin --> SAFR001, SAFR003, SFR007, AIFR005 : Configure AI parameters and request investment opportunities  

Client --> CFR008: Receive financial news  
Client --> AIFR006: View anomaly transaction alerts (SFR008)  
Client --> AIFR009: Access contextualized news insights (SFR013)

@enduml